<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rambus started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rambus started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of Rambus Inc as an outperform.</p>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley was the lead underwriter of Rambus' May 14 initial public offering.</p>
<p>-- Rambus gained 1-3/8 to 31-3/4.</p>
